#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../../ (Documentation) / @../ (Packages and dependencies) / Builder packages

    # Builder packages

    The selected project builder supplies packages tied to its artefact model.
    This keeps browser and rendering APIs out of the core language.

    The HTML builder provides source-backed compile-time helpers through
    `@html` and binding-backed runtime drawing through `@web/canvas`. The
    @../../progress (progress matrix) records current support.

    ## Package pages

    - @./html/ (@html)
    - @./canvas/ (@web/canvas)
]

